  "description": "Find the maximum number of envelopes you can Russian doll (i.e., put one inside another). Sort by width ascending and height descending, then find the Longest Increasing Subsequence of heights.",
  "pseudocode": "1. envelopes.sort((a, b) => a[0] - b[0] || b[1] - a[1]);\n2. let tails = [];\n3. for (let [w, h] of envelopes) {\n4.   let idx = binarySearch(tails, h);\n5.   if (idx === tails.length) tails.push(h);\n6.   else tails[idx] = h;\n7. }",
